internship:
  eyebrow: Summer Internships
  heading: Our Internship Program
  body: >-
    Each summer we host highly motivated rising seniors with experience and
    interest in housing issues.
  tracks:
    - title: Data Engineering
      description: >-
        Join the Data team that keeps city data flowing into Tolemi's products.
        Use SQL to map large datasets to a central schema, maintain the scripts
        that pull data from websites and APIs, and contribute to our data
        standardization work.
    - title: Data Science
      description: >-
        Join our small Insights & Data Science team to develop new cross-city
        insights. Explore large datasets, build rule systems or machine
        learning models, and own an insight project from start to finish over
        the summer.
    - title: Software Engineering
      description: >-
        Work alongside our engineers on the software local governments use
        every day, writing and testing production code and shipping real
        improvements over the summer.
    - title: Marketing
      description: >-
        Help tell the story of how local governments use data to tackle housing
        issues, from customer spotlights and case studies to content for our
        website.
  outcomes: >-
    Some of our interns have come back to work with us, while others have gone
    on to academic research or work in government.
  photo:
    src: /uploads/careers/interns-2025.jpg
